SUMMARY:Train: Midosuji Line to Umeda\, JR Special Rapid to Kyoto\, JR Nara Line to Inari
DESCRIPTION:Osaka Metro Midosuji Line (M\, red) from Namba M20 toward 新大阪 Shin-Osaka\, 4 stops to Umeda M16. Walk to JR Osaka: JR Kyoto Line Special Rapid (新快速\, A) toward 京都・米原 (Kyoto / Maibara)\, ~29 min to Kyoto. Change to the JR Nara Line (D) local toward 奈良 Nara: Tofukuji\, then Inari.
LOCATION:Fushimi Inari Taisha
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Train: Midosuji Line to Umeda\, JR Special Rapid to Kyoto\, JR Nara Line to Inari
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-1-1795127100000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261111T164500Z
DTSTART:20261119T222500Z
DTEND:20261119T223000Z
SUMMARY:Train: JR Nara Line\, Inari → Kyoto
DESCRIPTION:JR Nara Line (D) from Inari toward 京都 Kyoto\, 2 stops. At Kyoto\, go through the 新幹線のりかえ (Shinkansen transfer) gates to the Tokyo-bound platform.
LOCATION:Kyoto Station
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Train: JR Nara Line\, Inari → Kyoto
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
