SUMMARY:Shinkansen: Hikari 640\, Kyoto 07:51 → Shizuoka 09:37\, reserved
DESCRIPTION:Tokaido Shinkansen Hikari 640 for 東京 Tokyo\, Kyoto 07:51\, through the Shinkansen transfer gates (新幹線のりかえ). Get off at 静岡 Shizuoka\, 09:37. The same train as from Shin-Osaka\, boarded one stop later
LOCATION:Shizuoka Station
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Shinkansen: Hikari 640\, Kyoto 07:51 → Shizuoka 09:37\, reserved
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
