UID:jp-trip-3-1795138380000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261111T164500Z
DTSTART:20261120T013300Z
DTEND:20261120T021500Z
SUMMARY:Bus: Justline bus 42\, 10:33 from Shizuoka Ekimae (stop 11)
DESCRIPTION:Justline bus 42 (日本平線) from the North Exit bus terminal\, stop 11\, for 日本平ロープウェイ (Nihondaira Ropeway). Get off at 日本平夢テラス入口 (Yume Terrace Iriguchi). Board at the back\, pay as you get off: Suica works. About hourly: 9:33\, 10:33\, 11:23 (timetable as of mid-2026). The 9:33 leaves before your train arrives
LOCATION:Nihondaira Yume Terrace
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Bus: Justline bus 42\, 10:33 from Shizuoka Ekimae (stop 11)
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
