DTSTAMP:20261111T164500Z
DTSTART:20261120T025500Z
DTEND:20261120T030000Z
SUMMARY:Ropeway: Nihondaira Ropeway\, return
DESCRIPTION:Nihondaira Ropeway from the top station next to the Yume Terrace\, every 10–15 min\, 5-minute ride. Keep the return ticket.
LOCATION:Kunozan Toshogu
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Ropeway: Nihondaira Ropeway\, return
TRIGGER:-PT15M
