DTSTART:20261120T043000Z
DTEND:20261120T052500Z
SUMMARY:Bus: Ropeway back\, 13:30 bus to Higashi-Shizuoka\, JR to Shimizu
DESCRIPTION:Justline bus 42 from the 日本平ロープウェイ stop at 13:30 (every hour at :30) to 東静岡駅南口 (Higashi-Shizuoka Station South Exit)\, ~30 min. Then JR Tokaido Line toward 富士・熱海 (Fuji / Atami)\, 2 stops to 清水 Shimizu. Kashi no Ichi is 5 minutes from the East Exit.
LOCATION:Kashi no Ichi Shimizu
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Bus: Ropeway back\, 13:30 bus to Higashi-Shizuoka\, JR to Shimizu
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
