DTSTAMP:20261111T164500Z
DTSTART:20261120T062000Z
DTEND:20261120T064500Z
SUMMARY:Bus: Bus from Shimizu Station
DESCRIPTION:Justline 三保山の手線 (Miho Yamanote Line) from the Shimizu Station East Exit bus terminal: look for 三保 (Miho) on the front\, about every 15 min on weekdays. Get off at 三保松原入口 (Miho-no-Matsubara Iriguchi)\, ~24 min\, then walk the pine boardwalk about 15 min to the beach.
LOCATION:Miho no Matsubara
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Bus: Bus from Shimizu Station
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
