DESCRIPTION:Justline 三保山の手線 from 三保松原入口 to 清水駅 Shimizu Station (weekday buses 16:50\, 17:00\, 17:20\; ~28 min)\, then JR Tokaido Line toward 静岡・浜松 (Shizuoka / Hamamatsu)\, 3 stops to Shizuoka.
LOCATION:Shizuoka Station
