UID:jp-trip-10-1795207200000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261111T164500Z
DTSTART:20261120T204000Z
DTEND:20261120T210500Z
SUMMARY:Taxi: Two pre-booked taxis from Sanco Inn\, there and back
DESCRIPTION:On Friday evening ask the Sanco Inn front desk to book two taxis for 05:40 (3 per car) and to have them wait\, or come back at 06:50. Show the driver: 日本平夢テラス. The outdoor deck (展望回廊) is open all night\; the building opens at 9:00. Sunrise is about 06:26\, so be on the deck by 06:10. About ¥4\,200–5\,000 per car each way\, plus waiting time. No bus runs this early. Keep the rooms: you check out after you come back.
LOCATION:Nihondaira Yume Terrace
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Taxi: Two pre-booked taxis from Sanco Inn\, there and back
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
