SUMMARY:Shinkansen: Hikari 634\, 08:12 → Tokyo 09:09 (Hayatoku 7)
DESCRIPTION:Tokaido Shinkansen Hikari 634 for 東京 Tokyo. Book seat E for Mt Fuji: the best view is 8–10 minutes after leaving\, near the Fuji River bridge before Shin-Fuji. Backup: Hikari 636\, 08:41 → 09:42. Book 7+ days ahead on SmartEX
LOCATION:Tokyo Station Marunouchi Central Exit
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Shinkansen: Hikari 634\, 08:12 → Tokyo 09:09 (Hayatoku 7)
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
