SUMMARY:Walk: Walk from the Marunouchi side to Ote-mon gate
DESCRIPTION:Out through the Marunouchi Central Exit (丸の内中央口)\, straight along Gyoko-dori\, the ginkgo avenue\, to the moat\; turn right to the Ote-mon gate.
LOCATION:Otemon Gate Imperial Palace East Gardens
