SUMMARY:Metro: Tokyo Metro Chiyoda Line\, Otemachi → Meiji-jingumae (Harajuku)
DESCRIPTION:From Ote-mon walk 5 min to Otemachi station. Tokyo Metro Chiyoda Line (C\, green) toward 代々木上原 Yoyogi-Uehara\, Otemachi C11 → Meiji-jingumae〈Harajuku〉 C03\, 8 stops\, ~14 min. Follow signs to Meiji Jingu.
LOCATION:Meiji Jingu
