SUMMARY:Train: JR Yamanote Line\, Shinjuku → Ueno
DESCRIPTION:Walk to the East Exit (東口) of JR Shinjuku. JR Yamanote Line from platform 15\, toward 池袋・上野 (Ikebukuro / Ueno): Shinjuku JY17 → Ueno JY05\, ~25 min. Leave Ueno by the Iriya Exit (入谷口)\, 2 min to Grids. Check-in closes at 23:00.
LOCATION:Ueno Station
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Train: JR Yamanote Line\, Shinjuku → Ueno
